 effectively conduct risk identification and analysis activities.',false,null,'3',null,null,1),('risk-identification','3','Identify the Risk','Respective Working Units Officer','Identifies potential risks related to operational, strategic, financial, compliance, or reputational areas within their respective unit.',false,null,'4',null,null,2),('risk-identification','4','Analyze the risk','Risk Management Team','Analyzes identified risks by assessing their likelihood of occurrence, potential impact, root causes, and existing control measures.',false,null,'5',null,null,3),('risk-identification','5','Evaluate the risk','Risk Management Team','Evaluates analyzed risks against predefined risk appetite and tolerance levels to determine their significance and priority.',false,null,'6',null,null,4),('risk-identification','6','Propose risk control/response method','Risk Management Team','Proposes appropriate risk response strategies such as risk mitigation, transfer, avoidance, or acceptance based on the evaluation results.',false,null,'7',null,null,5),('risk-identification','7','Discuss and agreed on identified risk and controls','Senior Management','Conducts structured discussions to review identified risks and proposed controls, validate assumptions, and reach consensus on appropriate risk treatment actions in line ',true,'Do senior management approve the risks and controls?',null,'8','4',6),('risk-identification','8','Prepare risk identification report','Risk Management Team','Prepares a detailed report consolidating identified risks, analysis outcomes, evaluation results, and recommended responses.',false,null,'9',null,null,7),('risk-identification','9','Receive and review the report','CEO','Reviews the risk identification and analysis report to ensure completeness, accuracy, and alignment with strategic direction and governance requirements before approval.',true,'Does the CEO approve the risk report?',null,'10','4',8),('risk-identification','10','Register risk','Risk Management Team','Officially records approved risks, risk ratings, controls, and ownership into the risk register to enable systematic monitoring, reporting, and follow-up.',false,null,null,null,null,9),('risk-response','1','Communicate Identified risk','Risk Management Team','Communicates approved risks, response strategies, and assigned responsibilities to all relevant stakeholders to ensure awareness, accountability, and coordinated implemen',false,null,'2',null,null,0),('risk-response','2','Assign representatives','Respective Working Units Director','Assigns responsible representatives or risk owners within working units to implement, monitor, and report on approved risk response actions.',false,null,'3',null,null,1),('risk-response','3','Schedule mitigation plan','Risk Management Team + Respective Working Units Director','Develops a structured mitigation plan that outlines actions, timelines, milestones, responsible parties, and required resources for implementing approved risk responses.',false,null,'4',null,null,2),('risk-response','4','Review the plan','Respective CXO','Reviews the mitigation plan to assess feasibility, adequacy of controls, resource availability, and alignment with organizational priorities before endorsement.',true,'Does the CXO approve the mitigation plan?',null,'5','3',3),('risk-response','5','Implement the response','Respective Working Units Director','Executes approved risk response actions according to the mitigation plan, ensuring compliance with defined controls, timelines, and performance expectations.',true,'Is the implemented response effective?',null,'7','6',4),('risk-response','6','Review response','Respective Working Units Director','Reviews the progress and quality of implemented risk responses by tracking action completion, compliance, and effectiveness against predefined criteria.',true,'Is a new response needed?',null,'11','7',5),('risk-response','7','Ensure and evaluate implemented response','Risk Management Team','Evaluates whether implemented responses have effectively reduced the likelihood or impact of risks and determines residual risk levels.',true,'Can the risk be managed?',null,'8','10',6),('risk-response','8','Update Risk registry','Risk Management Team','Updates the risk register with current implementation status, residual risk ratings, issues identified, and corrective actions taken.',false,null,'9',null,null,7),('risk-response','9','Communicate all stakeholders','Risk Management Team','Communicates updated risk status, outcomes, and decisions to stakeholders to ensure transparency and informed decision-making.',false,null,'10',null,null,8),('risk-response','10','Discuss on the assessment findings and review the Response','Risk Management Team + Respective Working Units Director','Reviews assessment findings, discusses effectiveness of responses, and decides whether additional actions or adjustments are required.',true,'Is a new response needed?',null,'11','7',9),('risk-response','11','Propose other Response option','Respective Working Units Director','Proposes alternative or additional risk response options where existing controls are ineffective or residual risk remains above acceptable levels.',false,null,'12',null,null,10),('risk-response','12','Review Risk Control','Respective CXO','Reviews revised or additional risk control measures to ensure adequacy, sustainability, and alignment with organizational risk appetite.',true,'Does the CXO approve the new risk control?',null,'13','6',11),('risk-response','13','Review risk control','CEO','Provides final review and approval of revised or escalated risk control measures, ensuring strategic alignment and governance oversight.',true,'Does the CEO approve the risk control?',null,'5','6',12)) as v(code,no,name,actor,descr,g,gq,nx,y,n,sort) join process_defs d on d.code=v.code and d.unit_id='56bdc553-5f16-5df4-be26-a996e0de5165';
